*Notes:*
There are 3 (three) dos binary files for distribution

slam771a.zip :
  ascii(ansi) only dos binary, requires device ansi.sys for
  ascii/console display.

slam771b.zip :
  includes 'slam771a' but also includes VGA and does not require
  device driver ansi.sys even if run in ascii/console mode.

slam771c.zip :
  includes 'slam771b', but also includes the Allegro interface.
  this is the full package, all 3 dos interfaces available.


